00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:25,025
so I could live by your power, so I could know you, so I could show your love.

444
00:32:25,786 --> 00:32:30,551
Help me to live by faith, every day by faith, living for you.

445
00:32:31,091 --> 00:32:32,172
My life is not my own.

446
00:32:32,693 --> 00:32:33,634
I give it all to you.

447
00:32:34,214 --> 00:32:35,576
In Jesus' name I pray.

448
00:32:36,417 --> 00:32:38,499
Church, can you celebrate, give God glory?

449
00:32:38,539 --> 00:32:39,640
Come on, come on, come on.

